<title>USA: State Street rumored to tap corp bond mart.</title>
<headline>State Street rumored to tap corp bond mart.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Boston Corp is rumored to be planning to tap the corporate bond new issue market with $300 million in capital securities, syndicate sources said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 30-year maturity callable after 10 years, the sources said.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
